                <head>No. 666<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>On February 17 and 18 Secretary of State Dulles discussed the Saar with Bidault
                    at Berlin and with Adenauer at Wahn Airport. For records of these conversations,
                    see the memorandum by the Secretary of State, <ref
                        target="frus:frus1952-54v07p1/d497">Document 497</ref>, and the memorandum
                    of conversation by MacArthur, <ref target="frus:frus1952-54v07p1/d527">Document
                        527</ref>.</p>
            </div>
